         splash screen live as XML resources (read before any Compose code runs), so the brand
         color has to be duplicated here rather than referenced from the Kotlin palette. -->
    <color name="brand_indigo">#2563EB</color>
    <color name="brand_indigo_dark">#1D4ED8</color>
    <color name="white">#FFFFFF</color>
</resources>
